# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxrender
pkgver=0.9.12
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X Rendering Extension client library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libx11)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libXrender-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('b832128da48b39c8d608224481743403ad1691bf4e554e4be9c174df171d1b97')

build() {
    cd libXrender-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd libXrender-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
